                             "Shiny Leaves!\r"
                             "Let me turn them into a crown!\n"
                             "And what’s more...\f"
                             "I will give you this, too!\r", "Ethan: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n"
                                                             "How is your Pokémon you’re\f"
