                             "walking with?\r"
                             "You can talk to it as you walk from time\n"
                             "to time to nurture your friendship!\r"
                             "...\n"
                             "Oh!\r"
                             "You found a Shiny Leaf!\n"
                             "Let me see!\r"
                             "Ha! You’ve collected...\r"
                             "{STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0}!\r"
                             "Way to go!\n"
